 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Operations run in order on an initially empty number line of non-negative positions. [1, x] places an obstacle at x (placing one where an obstacle already stands changes nothing). [2, x, size] checks the size positions x - size to x - 1 and appends the character \"1\" to the result when none holds an obstacle, otherwise \"0\"; checks change nothing. Return the result as one string (empty when there are no checks).",
